{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Sky Harvest</strong> is a cozy farming and life-sim adventure among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow crops, explore sky islands, and build your dream home in a peaceful world above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/da382e758426430f586f900f7dc5448b.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span>A cozy life-sim adventure set in a breathtaking world of floating islands. <br>Grow, explore, and connect with nature and its people as you shape your new home in the skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/f89783d4bceb00ba863ff4b52518580b.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take to the skies aboard your trusty airship. Discover hidden islands, ancient ruins, and breathtaking landscapes filled with secrets and treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/b2efa09b819b7d9bd005370f09169a0a.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant seeds, care for your crops, and bring life back to the land. From humble sprouts to lush fields \u2014 your farm will flourish among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/8e431445289696db57c29dfdd85d2308.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relax by crystal lakes, catch rare fishes, and gather ingredients for recipes and crafting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/ce1fbea25b641b56ad92cb6724d0803a.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Express your style with unique outfits and accessories. Be who you want to be in your skybound world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/a15fbbfcb8134c376ec068e72c061446.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet charming villagers, share gifts, unlock heartwarming stories, and build meaningful connections across the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/cb595d997096b467c352b90de44c3408.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn your harvests into delicious meals and serve travelers from across the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/9ca59be8b604afd12d2482641f5a16f5.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/9ca59be8b604afd12d2482641f5a16f5.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/dbe06920ba2e735ac0d3876d7e694fd4.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, craft, decorate, and unwind at your own pace in this gentle, story-rich world above the clouds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f Crafting - Craft unique tools to enhance your day to day tasks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc9d Relationship Building - Make friends and unlock unique perks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd0e Quests - There's always something or someone in need of your help.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Merchant System - Buy and sell anything and everything through local shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/485823a987750306f8cdb2bb75b148c3.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=125 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/236d0a0541063ce4d6c555dfd3d6e2cb.avif?t=1769760175\" width=795 height=1024 /></span>Note from developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider Wishlisting the game to support it and if you want to follow along with the progress of the game's development and other BTS, you can watch it on YouTube @hamzahgamedev.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where It All Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/288c56fde18763b0b0b47f45b0d452514f2e3555.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/0751a5f70d8b8823e0d5b45f8e17532b692c6b97.jpg"},{"name":"Sky Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/0e02c0a3106fb4077b864c3a766dd3bc1116b07a.jpg"},{"name":"Back to Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/5fb2ffe338d2da53825a600178e01838b72664cd.jpg"},{"name":"First Catch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/78830a305b599c2b2327bfb432068daaccb488de.jpg"},{"name":"Hooked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/b44baefdd0d31ac4def82d538aff41922a9dddc4.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Angler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/b713154428bc419eb7e58fa73d179a305c21f1d2.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/df3cc1f848ff6cd65b1673f63148802aa24004fe.jpg"},{"name":"Social Butterfly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/d78b4bef70a50bf1eb960f8bc1e3f506d74bf5c1.jpg"},{"name":"Born to Fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2482840/629cbed7ccce955ba1eb63c297bce1012d1b653f.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2482840?t=1769760175","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/ff4b1c755729655d6619cd7174343cbb51e05dd2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769760175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/c6dc7bddc7f03bbf9eba5a81179afe8fe95811b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769760175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/c6dc7bddc7f03bbf9eba5a81179afe8fe95811b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769760175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2629160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Sky Harvest</strong> is a cozy farming and life-sim adventure among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow crops, explore sky islands, and build your dream home in a peaceful world above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/da382e758426430f586f900f7dc5448b.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span>A cozy life-sim adventure set in a breathtaking world of floating islands. <br>Grow, explore, and connect with nature and its people as you shape your new home in the skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/f89783d4bceb00ba863ff4b52518580b.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take to the skies aboard your trusty airship. Discover hidden islands, ancient ruins, and breathtaking landscapes filled with secrets and treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/e9368d79d44ba5c89cbcfe7c79601c5f.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/b2efa09b819b7d9bd005370f09169a0a.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant seeds, care for your crops, and bring life back to the land. From humble sprouts to lush fields \u2014 your farm will flourish among the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/7e494a4d25e67ec99d7a2f2a1637f5b6.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/8e431445289696db57c29dfdd85d2308.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relax by crystal lakes, catch rare fishes, and gather ingredients for recipes and crafting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/baa442f408583e1e7c1400651270667b.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/ce1fbea25b641b56ad92cb6724d0803a.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Express your style with unique outfits and accessories. Be who you want to be in your skybound world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/6fcd3c789d704de5887d9d3c700e36da.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/a15fbbfcb8134c376ec068e72c061446.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet charming villagers, share gifts, unlock heartwarming stories, and build meaningful connections across the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.poster.avif?t=1769760175\" width=1070 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482840/extras/40cd8f448e5efe1a9a2d7d83e465b816.webm?t=1769760175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\